OL,3,GNEWSARescue to continue overnight for
OL,4,Avessel carrying five in the Channel
OL,5,
OL,6,FRescue efforts for a vessel "in
OL,7,Fdistress" in the English Channel with
OL,8,Ffive people on board will continue
OL,9,Fovernight, the Maritime and Coastguard
OL,10,FAgency has said.
OL,12,FA helicopter, plane and lifeboats were
OL,13,Flaunched on Saturday evening south-west
OL,14,Fof Eddystone Lighthouse off Plymouth.
OL,16,FFurther details about the type of boat
OL,17,Finvolved and the nature of the
OL,18,Femergency have not been confirmed by
OL,19,Fofficials.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
