OL,3,GNEWSARescue to continue overnight for
OL,4,Avessel carrying five in the Channel
OL,5,
OL,6,FRNLI lifeboats from Falmouth and
OL,7,FPlymouth have been joined by a number
OL,8,Fof civilian vessels which are assisting
OL,9,Fthe operation.
